  "substitutions": [
    "React hooks/createElement are inert standard interfaces; img props captured without DOM/network.",
    "Class-name helpers and component CSS-variable styler are inert; they do not control src/crossOrigin/referrerPolicy.",
    "Expected HTTP fields come directly from actual original CDP ExtraInfo H2 records, never the Dart implementation."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Decoded HTTP field values/presence/raw target/empty body only; ordering/HPACK/frames/TLS are not established by CDP.",
    "Two observed priority states are explicit inputs, not a recreation of browser viewport scheduling.",
    "Explicit browser Accept-Language input; selected UI locale alone is insufficient to reconstruct it.",
    "mosaic.scdn.co was not observed; neither it nor other artwork routes are admitted."
